WEBVTT

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:05.620
Today's guest is Mr. Satyajit Shyamalan.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:06.520
I'm telling you the truth, Ms. Yamauchi!

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.290
I saw it with my own eyes, <i>twice!</i>

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:12.360
No! It's not the usual sensationalistic crap!

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.860
I mean, sure, I won't ask
you to believe me just like that...

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.030
I'll get you proof!

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:18.030
Satyajit Shyamalan has been called
the flag-bearer of the new generation

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.830
I knew it...

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.070
for running the "viralateral net,"

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:25.200
hyped in the U.S. as the
favorite to become Web 3.0.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.570
He's the owner/producer of
the Playmaker Industrial Company,

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:27.870
Jeez, Sanada, flattery like
this doesn't suit your character.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:31.870
the brains behind "The End," which
has been such a great hit in Japan.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.470
Aw, they went soggy...

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:37.410
I love giving people a good time.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:40.880
And how do you define a
good time, Mr. Shyamalan?

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:45.390
Being alive is what's a good time.
It's what gives us joy.

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:48.820
All of you alive today are
the world's true success stories.

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:27.690
Oh, this feels so good!

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:31.660
Earth may be a hick planet,
but the baths are great!

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:33.800
This is the best!

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:35.790
And the other thing that's the best is...

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.640
White rice!

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:42.370
Time to eat!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:45.210
You ask me to switch bodies,
and this is what you do?!

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:48.480
Just take a bath and eat?!

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:51.110
You sure you're not glad that Tuto is gone?

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:08.450
Huh?!

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:15.400
Wh-What's going on?!

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:16.970
Pipe down!

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:19.740
Quit making a fuss about every
little thing! We're just in space!

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.480
S-Sorry...

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:24.480
Wait, what do you mean, in space?!

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:27.480
Your body's restoration
has officially been approved.

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.850
Nobody told me anything about that!

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:33.490
That's not my fault! The communication
came while you were sleeping!

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:35.060
Hey! You hit me, didn't you!

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:39.260
La la la la la I <i>can't hear you!</i>

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.560
What are you, a kid?!

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:43.100
So, how soon can we get back home?

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:45.330
In Earth time, about a day.

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.000
What about school?!

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:50.040
I have midterms coming up, you know!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:53.410
What's more <i>important:</i> tests or your body?

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:54.610
My body.

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:56.600
That's what I thought.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.610
Take us through the corridor to Oriotera.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:09.090
Hayamiya, hurry up and wrap up
the Classical Japanese Lit notes!

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.790
What's your problem?
You haven't finished yet either!

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:15.970
Photos of celestial bodies, eh?
So you're a romantic, Hayamiya.

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:17.870
Oh, you think so?

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:20.300
Enough with the idle chitchat!

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:23.710
The important thing right now is
figuring out what's on next week's tests!

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:25.980
It's pathetic when a guy's
up against the wall like that.

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:26.980
What did you say?!

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:28.610
Sorry I'm late.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:29.910
Oh, hi, Nakasugi!

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.620
Hmm? Senkawa's not here yet?

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.620
I just got a text saying he's staying home sick.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:36.920
Oh...

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:39.590
Forget Senkawa, we need to
plan our cramming for the tests!

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:40.890
Nakasugi, you take math!

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:46.330
All right. Say, everyone, would you
like to come to my place on Sunday?

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:47.300
Your place?

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:49.430
You mean a cram session at your house?

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:54.600
No, my grandfather says he wants to
have a party to celebrate my recovery.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.570
Party?

00:04:56.570 --> 00:05:00.010
So he told me to invite my friends from school.

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:02.310
I'm not really into that stuff...

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:05.650
Of course we'll come! I'll tell Senkawa, too.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.080
Oh, good!

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:10.450
Nakasugi's place, eh? I wonder what it's like?

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.280
It's a totally normal house.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:19.100
Lailalo, approach via course 208.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.260
Roger.

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:22.260
That's your planet, Birdy?

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:23.530
Yep.

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:25.770
It's blue, just like Earth...

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.360
Pretty much.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:34.980
Navigator, the Lailalo's landing route is vermillion.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.780
Roger. Welcome home, Lailalo.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:39.220
Whoa!

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:41.220
I can see something! What is it?!

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:44.050
Shut up! Just keep quiet!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:59.870
Birdy Cephon, we will be the ones
transporting him to Econos-Quill.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.570
How long will it take?

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:04.470
We won't know that until
we do a thorough examination.

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:07.040
Please get him back to normal as soon as possible.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:09.880
We always do everything we can.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:18.190
Will my body really go back to normal?

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.060
There's nothing to worry about.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:23.690
They'll restore you perfectly, down
to the mole under your bellybutton.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:28.400
Investigator Birdy, we'll have you
undergo a thorough examination as well.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.830
Me too?!

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:32.270
Please get in the car.

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:34.100
What a pain...

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:38.610
There seem to be no abnormalities
in Birdy Cephon's biomatrix.

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:41.540
Let's make a written record of all this, just in case.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:46.350
Her neural entanglement circuits are fine, too.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.750
No, there's a slight disturbance...

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.120
<i>You're just an Altan!</i>

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:58.390
<i>What is this?</i>

00:06:58.390 --> 00:06:59.380
<i>Is this...</i>

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:04.630
<i>Birdy's...?</i>

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:16.150
He's big.

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:17.910
He's big, but he's definitely a bug.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:20.320
He's not a bug! He's Captain Megius!

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:23.720
Tsutomu, please bear with us a little longer.

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:26.060
I promise you that we will restore
your body to its original condition

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:28.920
and you'll be able to return to your normal life.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.890
Okay, thank you very much.

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:33.660
He's a bug, but he speaks like a normal person!

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:34.460
Cut it out!

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:39.270
Excuse me, Tsutomu, but I need
to speak with Birdy for a while.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.770
Oh, go ahead.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.170
Birdy.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:42.840
Yes, Sir?

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:45.830
I heard about Tuto. It's a shame.

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:48.680
Yes.

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:50.850
We'll salvage as much of
his functionality as we can,

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.980
but you'll need a new Marker.

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:56.750
Excuse me, Captain.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:57.790
Weegie!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.090
It's a dog! This one's a dog!

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:02.360
We have a report from the medical department.

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:04.260
This is Weegie Gahhow.

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:06.660
- She's a dog...
- Welcome home, Birdy.

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.650
Thank you.

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:14.970
Their risk of mental fusion is
within acceptable parameters, but...

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:17.170
What's "mental fusion"?

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:21.710
It's when the parapersonality
takes over the core personality.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:24.180
And what's a "parapersonality"?

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:25.680
You.

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:28.220
So the "core personality" is you, Birdy?

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:29.050
Yeah.

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:30.990
Hmm...

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.720
Whoa, hold on!

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:36.490
If I take you over, what happens to you?!

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:40.400
She disappears from this world,
Mr. Person Inside Birdy.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:42.330
This boy's name is Tsutomu.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.500
Birdy! Aren't you scared?! You'll disappear!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:48.300
I'm the one who messed
up and wrecked your body,

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:49.340
so I'll just have to risk it.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.370
But...

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:56.510
You don't need to worry. If we're in
acceptable range, there's no problem.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.500
Birdy.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.480
According to Econos-Quill,

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:04.590
the restoration should be finished
in about three Earth months.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:09.890
Three months? So in three months,
Tsutomu's body will be fixed?

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:12.030
Good for you, Tsutomu!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:13.230
Birdy...

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:16.330
I'm happy to hear it will be
finished sooner than we expected.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:18.330
Yes, Sir!

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:22.570
By the way, a certain someone was very
excited to find out you were coming home...

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:23.560
Oh?

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:28.440
I received word from Mr. Skeletso
that he was coming to see you.

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:29.850
Really, Weegie?!

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:31.050
Yes.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:32.750
Who's that?

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.220
He used to be my advisor.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.920
Your teacher?

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.890
I think he's one of the
mobile security police now...

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.520
Birdy!

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:44.180
Instructor!

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:51.530
Birdy! You're looking well.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:53.740
It's been a long time, Instructor Skeletso!

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:55.640
What?! What?!

00:09:55.640 --> 00:10:00.610
Yes... Want to go a round?

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:01.600
Sure!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.070
We're not done yet!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.920
l-I'll tell you whatever you want!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:11.910
Yeah!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.460
What's the matter, Birdy?
You don't have your usual power.

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:19.130
Skeletso!

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:23.600
Really? Well, right now I'm living
with an Earthling consciousness.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:27.900
What?! No, that's no good! Get rid of that thing!

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:30.640
That old lizard guy is unreasonable!

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:31.630
Hey!

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:37.150
Listen up, guy inside! Show me your face.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.140
Y-Yes?

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.650
He's cute!

00:10:43.650 --> 00:10:45.350
Instructor Skeletso smiled!

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:46.790
It makes him even creepier.

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.330
Skeletso, I told you to save this for later.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:53.930
I know. You're worried about the
summons from the courthouse, right?

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:55.130
Courthouse?

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.960
Yeah. So stay quiet for a while, okay?

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:12.210
The prosecution is finished with this witness.

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:16.050
Wait! I told you, I only did it
because Geega threatened me!

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:18.790
I now summon investigator Birdy Cephon Altira.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:22.620
I didn't do anything wrong!
It was Geega and Bacillus's fault!

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:23.160
I now summon investigator Birdy Cephon Altira.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.130
I order the defendant to be quiet.

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:28.460
But Quekku Gini's just a transporter, a small fry.

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:30.300
Why summon Birdy?

00:11:30.300 --> 00:11:33.670
I don't know. Apparently someone
high up in the judiciary decided it.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.500
All right, now let's have the cross-examination.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.470
What's that?

00:11:56.730 --> 00:12:00.560
I am Pontiff Nechla Geeze Altira.

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:05.100
Nechla...

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:07.600
A pontiff is intervening?

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:10.940
She exists outside the law, so I imagine...

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:16.850
So Birdy's summons as a witness
was just an excuse to interrogate her?

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:18.040
Order!

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:22.550
The court hereby allows the pontiff's intervention.

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:30.930
Further, all testimony made
here will be strictly confidential.

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:32.920
Does that meet your needs?

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:38.200
Birdy Cephon Altira.

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:42.740
You have another name as well.
What are you commonly called?

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:47.580
O-Objection! The witness's
nickname has no relevance to this case.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:51.410
The witness's character has
great bearing on this matter.

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.450
Objection overruled.

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:55.550
What is your nickname?

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:58.320
"Birdy the Berserker Killer."

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:01.290
What a stirring name!

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:08.060
I see.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:11.900
It expresses your aggressive personality, then.

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:20.310
When you arrested the defendant,
you let two major criminals escape.

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:21.300
Yes.

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:27.580
So, what was the illegal object in their possession?

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:30.590
That's classified information in
an ongoing police investigation.

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:33.990
Do not forget that you are
being questioned by a pontiff.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.590
It is something called the Ryunka.

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:40.760
And what is the Ryunka?

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:42.800
That's...

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:47.370
You are on the stand. Tell me everything you know.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:51.140
I haven't been given detailed
information on the Ryunka.

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:53.640
So you were investigating two fugitives

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:57.380
without even knowing what they were carrying?

00:13:57.380 --> 00:14:00.020
One final question.

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:05.190
In the process of investigating the
fugitives and their mysterious cargo,

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:10.180
you killed an inhabitant of the
primitive planet Earth, did you not?

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.700
Don't tell me that
consciousness she's carrying is?

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.230
Yes.

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:20.870
Oh, God!

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:22.860
You killed him, did you not?

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:28.210
Please answer the question, Birdy Cephon Altira.

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:29.240
l...

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:34.150
Objection! That question has no
relevance whatsoever to this case!

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:35.850
- Further, the pontiff's
opinion presupposes too much!

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:38.190
- Switch with me, Birdy

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.390
Not now!

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.020
Just do it!

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:44.330
She's showing undue
contempt for the witness's rights!

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:45.330
Objection overruled.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:46.730
Excuse me!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.840
What are you trying to do?!

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:55.670
She's talking about me, right?

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:56.910
Who are you?

00:14:56.910 --> 00:15:01.080
I'm... I mean, my name is Tsutomu Senkawa.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:06.070
I'm the one who was...
"killed"...by Birdy. The Earthling.

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:13.060
Th-The court will now take a brief recess...

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:15.860
I shall allow it.

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:16.890
Continue.

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.700
Uh, well... I mean...

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:25.370
She didn't really "kill" me. I died,
but I'm not <i>dead.</i> No, wait...

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:27.570
Anyway, as you can see, I'm alive.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.540
It's true that sharing a body
with Birdy is inconvenient,

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:32.940
and we have a lot of problems,

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:35.440
but they say my body will be restored before long,

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:39.620
so um... Birdy didn't kill me!

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:46.220
I never thought I'd hear a murder
victim defending his killer.

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:49.630
Then I have a question for you as a
representative of Earth's inhabitants.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:50.330
Huh?

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.730
Nechla!

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:56.060
Please stand down, Birdy Cephon Altira.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:59.230
But I don't really know anything about trials...

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:01.600
It's an easy question.

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:04.810
Do you know what the Ryunka is?

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.140
No.

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:10.580
"Ryunka" means "invisible death"
in the ancient Empire language.

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:12.250
Huh?

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:13.650
Watch.

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:20.340
Huh?

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:27.090
What is this?

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.010
What did she do?!

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:45.480
It's the pontiff's Bindu Attack.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:48.450
He's being forced to vicariously experience

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:50.650
the contents of her historical records.

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:54.510
What the hell is this?!

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.640
In the Empire era,

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:10.570
the Ryunka wiped out the entire
population of the planet Bilugeva

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:12.910
in one instant.

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:16.750
Our histories have recorded this
event as "The Tragedy of Bilugeva."

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:18.310
The Ryunka did that?!

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:22.350
Do you understand, Earthling?
That is the power of the Ryunka.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:27.760
What if the Ryunka which caused the
Tragedy of Bilugeva is on Earth now?

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:31.690
What if Earth should follow
the same path as Bilugeva?

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.900
I don't want that!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:37.870
Have you all heard the Earthling's frank opinion?

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:40.870
And it was due to Birdy Cephon's
error during the initial investigation

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:45.270
that the Ryunka was carried to Earth!

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:48.410
But Birdy's working hard!

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:50.840
She's giving it her all!

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:01.780
Birdy Cephon Altira.

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:11.800
The Divine Council is monitoring your activities.

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.630
Don't forget that.

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:18.540
I'm finished.

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:20.480
W-Wait!

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:22.880
What about me?!

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:26.780
Ah, I forgot this was your trial.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:29.480
As a pontiff, I will pass down an extralegal ruling.

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:32.120
I sentence you to 25 years
with spiritual purification.

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:35.460
You're kidding! That's way
too harsh for just smuggling!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:39.490
That's a pontifical ruling. Accept it quietly.

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:43.600
In addition, all information we have
heard here pertaining to the Ryunka

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:46.330
is strictly confidential!

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.600
I trust you all understand that?

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.170
Nechla...

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:55.740
You used this trial to give me
that information about the Ryunka.

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:57.910
Let me make one thing <i>clear:</i>

00:18:57.910 --> 00:18:59.950
I hate you.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.580
I knew that already!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.620
The Sanctum Sanctorum must
have deliberately used Nechla

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.860
to pass on the information about the Ryunka to us.

00:19:08.860 --> 00:19:15.130
If nothing else, it seems clear that
the Ryunka is a relic of the Empire.

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:19.470
"Invisible death" in the
ancient Empire language, was it?

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:20.700
Yes.

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:22.970
Birdy, continue your investigation.

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:25.870
But the safety of the Earthlings
is priority number one.

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:27.680
Yes, Sir.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:32.450
Oh, and about a Buddy to replace Tuto...

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:34.480
I don't need a replacement for Tuto.

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:35.780
Birdy!

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:38.180
And I have a new Buddy already.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:42.790
Right here.

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:44.490
Huh?

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.320
I promised Tuto.

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:49.690
Well, I guess that's fine.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:55.830
We salvaged all the functionality we
could from what we recovered of Tuto.

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:01.840
I think this will aid you in your investigation.

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:05.380
It won't seem unnatural for an
Earthling to have something this shape.

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.810
Treasure that as if it were Tuto.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:16.830
Yes, Sir.

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:20.360
It's the Ryunka.

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:24.770
If the Ryunka awakens,
this world will be more fun.

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:29.200
Naturally, you have the right of first claim to it.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:34.740
After all, you've been of
great help to my work so far.

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:39.280
Now, let us enjoy ourselves, along with the Ryunka...

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:41.270
...to our hearts' content.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:49.560
It's been a long time since I last came here...

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:53.190
The people here look just like Earthlings.

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:56.030
Because they're Altans, like me.

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:57.430
"Altans"?

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:02.900
Is something going on?

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:04.900
It's people from the Union.

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:09.580
Is this your hometown?

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:12.950
I guess you could say that.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:15.320
I played here a lot as a kid.

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:19.950
See that shop on the corner?
The patilos there were so yummy...

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:25.980
The cars exploded!

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:30.800
Are you okay?

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:32.790
Hang in there!

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:43.650
<i>Let's go! Have a good time!</i>

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:32.960
<i>C'mon baby, c'mon baby, everybody yeah yeah</i>

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:34.660
<i>Let's go! Have a new time!</i>

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:37.500
<i>Everybody all de best na good smile</i>

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:41.470
<i>Happy smile, ima subete hitotsu ni naru</i>

00:22:41.470 --> 00:22:43.070
<i>Let's go! Have a new world!</i>

00:22:43.070 --> 00:22:46.340
<i>Don't worry tsunaida sono te wa hanasanai</i>

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:50.150
<i>Kitto kimi no asu no chikara ni naru</i>

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:51.580
<i>Let's go! Have a good time!</i>

00:22:51.580 --> 00:22:54.720
<i>Everybody peace de chiiku na happy time</i>

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:58.720
<i>Put your hands, ima hitotsu ni narou ze</i>

00:22:58.720 --> 00:23:00.060
<i>Let's go! Have a good time!</i>

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:03.530
<i>Everybody peace de chiiku na happy time</i>

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:09.160
<i>Put your hands, ima hitotsu ni narou ze</i>

00:23:10.930 --> 00:23:14.570
<i>Shion Arita here again, yessiree!</i>

00:23:14.570 --> 00:23:19.740
<i>It looks like Birdy and Tsutomu</i>
<i>aren't going back to Earth yet.</i>

00:23:19.740 --> 00:23:25.510
<i>And now a mean-looking</i>
<i>dog-shaped alien terrorist called Kinzel</i>

00:23:25.510 --> 00:23:29.380
<i>is threatening Birdy and Nechla...!</i>

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:34.690
<i>He's a really petty guy who</i>
<i>holds a grudge over the past!</i>

00:23:34.690 --> 00:23:38.890
<i>Beat him up good, Birdy!</i>
